{
 "about": "Cases every reader of what an agent says must pass (spec/markdown.md): its markdown, in; the blocks the apps draw, out. Written by hand from the spec.",
 "cases": [
  {
   "about": "emphasis, strong, strikethrough and code, inline",
   "markdown": "a *b* **c** ~~d~~ `e`",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "a "
      },
      {
       "text": "b",
       "emphasis": true
      },
      {
       "text": " "
      },
      {
       "text": "c",
       "strong": true
      },
      {
       "text": " "
      },
      {
       "text": "d",
       "strike": true
      },
      {
       "text": " "
      },
      {
       "text": "e",
       "code": true
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "styles nest: a run carries every style it is inside",
   "markdown": "**bold *both***",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "bold ",
       "strong": true
      },
      {
       "text": "both",
       "strong": true,
       "emphasis": true
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "a line break inside a paragraph is kept",
   "markdown": "one\ntwo",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "one\ntwo"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "headings keep their level",
   "markdown": "# One\n\n### Three\n\n###### Six",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "One"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "is": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "Three"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "is": "heading",
     "level": 6,
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "Six"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "fenced code keeps what is in it as written, and the first word of its fence as its language",
   "markdown": "```rust title\nlet x = **1**;\n  y\n```",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "code",
     "language": "rust",
     "text": "let x = **1**;\n  y"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "a fence not closed yet is code to the end: the agent is still saying it",
   "markdown": "Run:\n\n```\nmake",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "Run:"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "is": "code",
     "text": "make"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "lists nest: each item's depth is how many lists it is in; a bullet, or its number from where the list starts",
   "markdown": "- a\n  - b\n- c\n\n3. x\n4. y",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "a"
      }
     ],
     "depth": 1,
     "marker": {
      "is": "bullet"
     }
    },
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "b"
      }
     ],
     "depth": 2,
     "marker": {
      "is": "bullet"
     }
    },
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "c"
      }
     ],
     "depth": 1,
     "marker": {
      "is": "bullet"
     }
    },
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "x"
      }
     ],
     "depth": 1,
     "marker": {
      "is": "number",
      "n": 3
     }
    },
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "y"
      }
     ],
     "depth": 1,
     "marker": {
      "is": "number",
      "n": 4
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "an item's second block is in it, with no marker",
   "markdown": "1. first\n\n   more\n2. second",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "first"
      }
     ],
     "depth": 1,
     "marker": {
      "is": "number",
      "n": 1
     }
    },
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "more"
      }
     ],
     "depth": 1
    },
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "second"
      }
     ],
     "depth": 1,
     "marker": {
      "is": "number",
      "n": 2
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "task list items say whether they are done",
   "markdown": "- [ ] todo\n- [x] done",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "todo"
      }
     ],
     "depth": 1,
     "marker": {
      "is": "task",
      "done": false
     }
    },
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "done"
      }
     ],
     "depth": 1,
     "marker": {
      "is": "task",
      "done": true
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "a quote's blocks say how many quotes they are in",
   "markdown": "> said\n>\n> - in it\n>\n> > deeper\n\nout",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "said"
      }
     ],
     "quote": 1
    },
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "in it"
      }
     ],
     "quote": 1,
     "depth": 1,
     "marker": {
      "is": "bullet"
     }
    },
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "deeper"
      }
     ],
     "quote": 2
    },
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "out"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "a rule is a block of its own",
   "markdown": "a\n\n---\n\nb",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "a"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "is": "rule"
    },
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "b"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "a table: its columns' alignment, its head's cells, each row's cells, styled",
   "markdown": "| a | b | c |\n|:--|--:|:-:|\n| 1 | **2** | |\n| x |",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "table",
     "align": [
      "left",
      "right",
      "center"
     ],
     "head": [
      [
       {
        "text": "a"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "text": "b"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "text": "c"
       }
      ]
     ],
     "rows": [
      [
       [
        {
         "text": "1"
        }
       ],
       [
        {
         "text": "2",
         "strong": true
        }
       ],
       []
      ],
      [
       [
        {
         "text": "x"
        }
       ],
       [],
       []
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "a link to an https address, written or in angle brackets, is one",
   "markdown": "[the *site*](https://example.com/x?a=1) or <https://a.io>",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "the ",
       "link": "https://example.com/x?a=1"
      },
      {
       "text": "site",
       "emphasis": true,
       "link": "https://example.com/x?a=1"
      },
      {
       "text": " or "
      },
      {
       "text": "https://a.io",
       "link": "https://a.io"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "a link to anything but https stays text: its words, and nothing to tap",
   "markdown": "[x](javascript:alert(1)) [y](http://a.io) [z](/here) [w](HTTPS:evil) <mailto:a@b.c>",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "x y z w mailto:a@b.c"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "an https address written bare is a link, the punctuation that ends the sentence and a bracket it did not open left out",
   "markdown": "see https://example.com/a_(b). or (https://b.io/c), not http://plain.io nor xhttps://no.io",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "see "
      },
      {
       "text": "https://example.com/a_(b)",
       "link": "https://example.com/a_(b)"
      },
      {
       "text": ". or ("
      },
      {
       "text": "https://b.io/c",
       "link": "https://b.io/c"
      },
      {
       "text": "), not http://plain.io nor xhttps://no.io"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "an address in code is not a link",
   "markdown": "`https://a.io`\n\n```\nhttps://b.io\n```",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "https://a.io",
       "code": true
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "is": "code",
     "text": "https://b.io"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "raw HTML stays text, as written",
   "markdown": "<b>hi</b> there\n\n<script>alert(1)</script>",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "<b>hi</b> there"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "<script>alert(1)</script>"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "a block of raw HTML over several lines is its text, as written, its lines kept",
   "markdown": "<div>\n*x*\n</div>\n\nafter",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "<div>\n*x*\n</div>"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "after"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "an image is its words, tappable when its address is https; with none, its address",
   "markdown": "![a cat](https://e.com/c.png) ![x](data:abc) ![](https://e.com/d.png)",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "a cat",
       "image": true,
       "link": "https://e.com/c.png"
      },
      {
       "text": " "
      },
      {
       "text": "x",
       "image": true
      },
      {
       "text": " "
      },
      {
       "text": "https://e.com/d.png",
       "image": true,
       "link": "https://e.com/d.png"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "a paragraph or heading whose first letter is right-to-left is marked so; digits and punctuation before it decide nothing, nor do letters after it; code is as written",
   "markdown": "## مرحبا\n\n(1) «שלום» world\n\nHello عربي\n\n- نعم\n\n| a | ب |\n|--|--|\n\n```\nمرحبا\n```",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "مرحبا"
      }
     ],
     "rtl": true
    },
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "(1) «שלום» world"
      }
     ],
     "rtl": true
    },
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "Hello عربي"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "نعم"
      }
     ],
     "depth": 1,
     "marker": {
      "is": "bullet"
     },
     "rtl": true
    },
    {
     "is": "table",
     "align": [
      "none",
      "none"
     ],
     "head": [
      [
       {
        "text": "a"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "text": "ب"
       }
      ]
     ],
     "rows": []
    },
    {
     "is": "code",
     "text": "مرحبا"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "about": "an item with nothing in it is still one",
   "markdown": "- \n- b",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [],
     "depth": 1,
     "marker": {
      "is": "bullet"
     }
    },
    {
     "is": "paragraph",
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "b"
      }
     ],
     "depth": 1,
     "marker": {
      "is": "bullet"
     }
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
